      <h3 style="text-align:center;"> Logical reaction to the hits based on subconscious system</h3>
     
<p>
     In our today's world, with all scientific vicissitudes which is being realized, martial arts are developing too, among these improvements could mention to conscious and subconscious martial arts psychology.
     In the present article, theoretical and practical investigation has been carried out on the subconsciousness and its effect on the logical reaction to the hits in martial arts, first, there is the theoretical quality of defence reaction in the unconscious, in which it was stated that the defensive reaction techniques and affect of this reaction to logical reaction that received from subconscious system transform to logical subconscious process. 
     Having analyzed the result of the conscious mind, we have found that if we transform the defence techniques to the unconscious mind when a hit is to reach the opponent they will react unconsciously. Having said that, if( in the conditioning process) the reaction is saved in the unconscious mind logically, the response to the hit is also stemmed from the unconscious mind.  
  </p>

